# The cross-SDK fingerprint vectors are compared byte-for-byte against hashes
# produced by an independent implementation. Never let a checkout rewrite
# their line endings: a future vector carrying a literal newline inside a
# value would hash differently on Windows than on Linux, which is one SDK
# disagreeing with itself across two operating systems — the failure the
# shared fixture exists to prevent, arriving by a route the spec does not
# cover.
tests/fixtures/fingerprint/*.json -text
